{"seq":3,"slug":"causal-inference","title":"因果推断框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/foundations/causal-inference","wordCount":2040,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"因果推断框架\">因果推断框架</h1><p>吸烟者肺癌多，这是关联；吸烟导致肺癌，这是因果。从前者跳到后者，曾让 20 世纪中叶的统计学界争论数十年——费舍尔本人就坚持那可能是某种基因同时导致「想吸烟」与「易患癌」。这场争论催生了流行病学最核心的方法论：在无法对人随机分配吸烟的现实里，凭什么、在什么假设下，可以宣称一个观察到的关联是因果。本节给出现代流行病学回答这个问题的两套互补语言：潜在结果与因果图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>因果的现代定义建立在「反事实」之上：抽烟者老王得了肺癌，要问「抽烟是不是原因」，得问「假如老王这辈子不抽烟，他还会得肺癌吗」。这个「假如」永远无法对同一个人同时观测——他要么抽要么不抽，这就是因果推断的根本难题（fundamental problem of causal inference）。潜在结果框架把它形式化：每个个体都有两个潜在结果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y^{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（暴露时的结局）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y^{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（不暴露时的结局），个体因果效应是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y^{1}-Y^{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，但我们只能看到其中一个。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[观察到关联] --&gt; B{关联从何而来}&#10;    B --&gt; C[因果&lt;br/&gt;暴露真的影响结局]&#10;    B --&gt; D[机遇&lt;br/&gt;抽样波动]&#10;    B --&gt; E[偏倚&lt;br/&gt;选择·信息]&#10;    B --&gt; F[混杂&lt;br/&gt;第三因素]&#10;    C --&gt; G[在明确假设下&lt;br/&gt;估计平均因果效应]&#10;    D -.统计检验.-&gt; G&#10;    E -.设计与分析控制.-&gt; G&#10;    F -.调整·分层·DAG.-&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n    A[观察到关联] --&gt; B{关联从何而来}\n    B --&gt; C[因果&lt;br/&gt;暴露真的影响结局]\n    B --&gt; D[机遇&lt;br/&gt;抽样波动]\n    B --&gt; E[偏倚&lt;br/&gt;选择·信息]\n    B --&gt; F[混杂&lt;br/&gt;第三因素]\n    C --&gt; G[在明确假设下&lt;br/&gt;估计平均因果效应]\n    D -.统计检验.-&gt; G\n    E -.设计与分析控制.-&gt; G\n    F -.调整·分层·DAG.-&gt; G</pre><p>既然个体效应不可得，流行病学退而求其次估计「平均因果效应」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATE = E[Y^{1}] - E[Y^{0}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。下表对比两套主流框架，它们不是对立而是分工：DAG 帮你想清楚该调整谁，潜在结果帮你定义清楚要估什么。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>核心对象</th>\n<th>擅长回答</th>\n<th>关键假设</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>潜在结果（Rubin）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y^{1}, Y^{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>效应估计、可识别性</td>\n<td>可交换性、一致性、正性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果图（Pearl DAG）</td>\n<td>变量间有向箭头</td>\n<td>该调整谁、避免哪些坑</td>\n<td>因果马尔可夫、忠实性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可交换性与三大识别假设\">可交换性与三大识别假设</h2><p>要让观测到的两组结局差等于平均因果效应，必须满足三个假设。第一是可交换性（exchangeability）：暴露组与非暴露组除暴露外在影响结局的因素上「可互换」，即无未测量混杂。随机化之所以是因果推断的金标准，正因它在期望意义上保证了可交换性。第二是一致性（consistency）：定义里的「暴露」与现实里发生的暴露是同一回事——「肥胖的因果效应」就因「怎么变瘦」（节食、手术、生病）路径各异而饱受一致性质疑。第三是正性（positivity）：每个协变量层里暴露与不暴露都得有人，否则那一层无从比较。</p>\n<p>这三条假设有个共同的尴尬：可交换性与一致性都无法被数据本身验证。你算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATE</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是否可信，最终押在「我是否调整了所有重要混杂、我的暴露定义是否良定义」这些研究者的判断上。这就是为什么因果推断不是一道纯计算题，而是一场需要专业知识背书的论证——数据只负责在假设给定后算出数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"因果图与混杂-对撞-中介\">因果图与混杂、对撞、中介</h2><p>有向无环图（DAG）用箭头表示因果方向，是 2000 年后流行病学避免「调整错变量」的标准工具。它把三类结构刻画得一目了然。混杂结构是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E \\leftarrow C \\rightarrow Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span>：公共原因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 同时影响暴露与结局，必须调整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 才能切断这条后门路径。中介结构是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E \\rightarrow M \\rightarrow Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 在因果链中间，若你想要总效应就不能调整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，否则会把真效应抹掉。对撞结构是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E \\rightarrow K \\leftarrow Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是暴露与结局的共同后果，调整它反而会凭空制造关联——这就是声名狼藉的「对撞偏倚」。</p>\n<p>DAG 给出一条机械的规则：要估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 的因果效应，需找到一组变量阻断所有「后门路径」，且不打开任何对撞。这条规则把「该调整哪些变量」从凭感觉升级为可画图、可检验的推理。它和实操中的混杂识别紧密相关，详见 <a href=\"../bias-effects/bias-confounding\">偏倚与混杂</a>；而中介结构下「调整还是不调整」的两难，又牵出 <a href=\"../bias-effects/effect-modification\">效应修饰与交互</a> 中对效应分解的讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hill-准则-从关联走向因果判断的检查单\">Hill 准则：从关联走向因果判断的检查单</h2><p>在 DAG 与潜在结果尚未成形的 1965 年，奥斯汀·布拉德福德·希尔提出了九条「因果考量」，至今仍是流行病学家做整体判断时的常备检查单。它们不是充要条件，而是权衡证据时要逐条审视的角度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>准则</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>注意</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>关联强度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越难被混杂解释</td>\n<td>弱关联不等于无因果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>不同人群、设计重复出现</td>\n<td>系统误差可重复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特异性</td>\n<td>暴露专对某结局</td>\n<td>单因多果时不适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序性</td>\n<td>因必先于果</td>\n<td>唯一不可或缺的一条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剂量反应</td>\n<td>暴露越多结局越多</td>\n<td>阈值效应可破坏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合理性</td>\n<td>有生物学机制</td>\n<td>受时代认知局限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致协调</td>\n<td>与已知事实不矛盾</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验证据</td>\n<td>干预后结局改变</td>\n<td>证据力最强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类比</td>\n<td>类似因果已知</td>\n<td>最弱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>九条里只有时序性是逻辑上不可缺少的——因必须先于果。其余各条是加权而非否决项：弱关联可能是真因果（如被动吸烟与肺癌），强关联也可能全是混杂。Hill 准则的现代价值，是提醒研究者把 DAG 算出的数字放回生物学与既有证据的语境里通盘判断，而非孤立看一个 p 值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标试验模拟-当代观察因果的主流范式\">目标试验模拟：当代观察因果的主流范式</h2><p>理论上随机对照试验能直接满足可交换性，但很多问题不能或不该做试验——不能随机分配人去吸烟，也来不及为每个新药等十年试验。2020 年代流行病学的回应是「目标试验模拟」（target trial emulation, TTE）：先明确写出「假如能做这个随机试验，它的入组标准、干预方案、随访起点、结局、估计量会是什么」，再用现成的观察数据（如电子健康档案、医保数据库）逐项去逼近这个虚拟试验，从而系统性地暴露并堵住「不死时间偏倚」「时间零点错位」等观察研究的经典陷阱。</p>\n<p>这一范式已从前沿走向规范。2025 年 <em>PLOS Medicine</em> 宣布，所有依赖目标试验模拟的投稿必须遵循新发布的 TARGET（Transparent Reporting of Observational Studies Emulating a Target Trial）报告规范——一份 21 条清单，要求显式写出假想试验协议的入选标准、干预策略、分组、随访期、结局定义、因果对比（估计量）与分析计划，并说明如何用观察数据模拟每一环（来源：PLOS Medicine, 2025）。TTE 不创造新假设，它仍依赖无未测量混杂，但它把「我到底在估什么因果对比」逼问得清清楚楚，这正是经典观察研究最容易含糊之处。它的具体落地，与 <a href=\"../study-design/cohort-studies\">队列研究</a> 的随访设计、<a href=\"../applications/surveillance-evidence\">监测与循证决策</a> 的证据分级直接相通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>因果的现代定义是反事实：个体效应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y^{1}-Y^{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不可观测，故退而估计平均因果效应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATE</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>识别因果效应需三大假设——可交换性（无未测量混杂）、一致性、正性，前两者无法由数据验证。</li>\n<li>DAG 把混杂（调整）、中介（视目标取舍）、对撞（切勿调整）三类结构机械化，给出「阻断后门、不开对撞」的调整规则。</li>\n<li>Hill 九准则是整体判断的检查单，时序性是唯一不可缺项，其余为加权考量。</li>\n<li>目标试验模拟是当代观察因果的主流范式，2025 年起 TARGET 规范（21 条）成为顶刊投稿要求，把因果对比逼问清晰但仍依赖无未测量混杂。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"因果推断框架","id":"因果推断框架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可交换性与三大识别假设","id":"可交换性与三大识别假设"},{"level":2,"text":"因果图与混杂、对撞、中介","id":"因果图与混杂-对撞-中介"},{"level":2,"text":"Hill 准则：从关联走向因果判断的检查单","id":"hill-准则-从关联走向因果判断的检查单"},{"level":2,"text":"目标试验模拟：当代观察因果的主流范式","id":"目标试验模拟-当代观察因果的主流范式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"疾病频率测量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/foundations/disease-frequency"},"next":{"title":"队列研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/study-design/cohort-studies"}}